url":"https://api.github.com/users/pixeltrain3D/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-20T14:29:42Z","updated_at":"2025-06-20T14:29:42Z","body":"Ok, bisected it to: [5a30a7e7cd5d5f0f8cb019d4765a46219ecf8e56] Add shader baker to project exporter.\nHope, that a workable solution will be found. Thanks for your help.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2991840920/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2991861272","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107753#issuecomment-2991861272","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107753","id":2991861272,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yVC4Y","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-20T14:37:34Z","updated_at":"2025-06-20T14:37:34Z","body":"> Hope, that a workable solution will be found. \n\nAre there any issues with using Mobile renderer instead of Forward+? I think using it on Intel macs was the intended solution when shader backer was merged. Pretty much no one of developers own Intel mac anymore, so it would be hard to test and fix.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2991861272/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2991913164","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107753#issuecomment-2991913164","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107753","id":2991913164,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yVPjM","user":{"login":"pixeltrain3D","id":96491690,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcBYqg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96491690?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pixeltrain3D","html_url":"https://github.com/pixeltrain3D","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pixeltrain3D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pixeltrain3D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pixeltrain3D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pixeltrain3D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pixeltrain3D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pixeltrain3D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pixeltrain3D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pixeltrain3D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pixeltrain3D/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-20T14:48:17Z","updated_at":"2025-06-20T14:48:17Z","body":"The \"Mobile renderer\" seems to work as far as I can see in my project. With the shift from Forward+ to Mobile we will loose also many 3d features for desktop like all not baked GI solutions, Volumetric Fog,  Screenspaced Reflections etc.\nSo, this change is a big change which should be communicated well before updating a project to 4.5\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2991913164/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2991915370","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107753#issuecomment-2991915370","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107753","id":2991915370,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yVQFq","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-20T14:49:07Z","updated_at":"2025-06-20T15:12:07Z","body":"Try the following patch:\n\n```diff\ndiff --git a/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shaders/cluster_render.glsl b/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shaders/cluster_render.glsl\nindex 4a4299080f..91ab748835 100644\n--- a/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shaders/cluster_render.glsl\n+++ b/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shaders/cluster_render.glsl\n@@ -114,7 +114,11 @@ void main() {\n        uint aux = 0;\n\n        uint cluster_thread_group_index;\n+#ifndef MOLTENVK_USED\n        if (!gl_HelperInvocation) {\n+#else\n+       {\n+#endif\n                //https://advances.realtimerendering.com/s2017/2017_Sig_Improved_Culling_final.pdf\n\n                uvec4 mask;\n@@ -147,7 +151,11 @@ void main() {\n        uint z_write_offset = cluster_offset + state.cluster_depth_offset + element_index;\n        uint z_write_bit = 1 << z_bit;\n\n+#ifndef MOLTENVK_USED\n        if (!gl_HelperInvocation) {\n+#else\n+       {\n+#endif\n                z_write_bit = subgroupOr(z_write_bit); //merge all Zs\n                if (cluster_thread_group_index == 0) {\n                        aux = atomicOr(cluster_render.data[z_write_offset], z_write_bit);\n```\nIf it is sufficient to make it work, I think we can put it back without any issues. If not, I'm not sure.\n\nFor the reference, on M4 mac `OmniLight3D` and `SportLight3D` in Forward+/Vulkan seems to work the same both with and without this patch.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2991915370/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2991935342","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107753#issuecomment-2991935342","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107753","id":2991935342,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yVU9u","user":{"login":"pixeltrain3D","id":96491690,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcBYqg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96491690?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pixeltrain3